  "title": "btatt: Fix direction of Mesh Proxy Data In",
  "description": "Mesh Provisioning Data In and Mesh Proxy Data In are the\nreverse direction of a duplex link, and are for the opposite\ndirection of the original request.\n\nSee the file in #15812 for an example. (Note that the retransmission\ndetection must be off for it to work, and the keys mentioned in the\nissue must be configured.)\n\nFixup a4904bc1dd9f1866f04f2aaabbe164e73b59bce1",
